OL,3,GNEWSAWhat you need to know about
OL,4,Achanges to the planning system
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew rules on who decides planning
OL,7,Fapplications have been introduced to
OL,8,Fcouncils across the country.
OL,10,FThe government says planning officers,
OL,11,Frather than councillors, should decide
OL,12,Fmost applications unless exemptions
OL,13,Fapply.
OL,15,FThe government says the changes will
OL,16,Fprovide greater clarity and consistency
OL,17,Fon how planning decisions are made
OL,18,Facross England.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
