OL,3,GNEWSAWhat you need to know about
OL,4,Achanges to the planning system
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut critics say that reducing the role
OL,7,Fof elected councillors will make the
OL,8,Fsystem less democratic and transparent.
OL,9,FThey raise concerns that this will
OL,10,Ferode public confidence in the planning
OL,11,Fprocess.
